From 23635ee73fa9c1e3cb4ea6a03cda6d5d893a78f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: solar-tv <solar-tv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:59:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(uniswap-v2): Pair backend stages on getReserves
 calls

scripts/verify/uniswap_v2_pair_stages.sh generates UniswapV2Pair's
exported stages from the pinned port, writes the kernel proofs of every
backend stage on the calls of one external function (certify.py --only,
--fuel) and builds them one module at a time with receipts, then audits
every theorem's axioms. For getReserves() all 33 stages from the first
lowered MIR to the final EVM IR check, composed into
uv2_gr_mir_to_evmir, and the runtime bytecode decodes to the final EVM
IR. NEGATIVES=1 requires mutants of mir1, evm26 and the bytecode to fail
with a mismatch. The generated files derive from the GPL-3.0 port and
are not committed.
---
